{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And Sarai</b> Two times in the Masorah: ושרי אשת אברם. ושרי ביששכר עם דבורה. Teaches that she was as distinguished as the matriarchs." "<b>And to her</b> Four times in the Masorah: ולה שפחה מצרית. ולה שני פיות. ולה אמר עלי לשלום. ולה גפין ארבע בחיה. שראה דניאל. This is what they expounded: ותלך ותתע — she returned to the idols of her father, and that is ולה שתי פיות — she returned to having a second mouth to give thanks to idolatry. And once she repented, he took her back, as they said: Keturah is Hagar, and that is ולה אמר עלי לשלום. ולה גפין ארבע also refers to the kingdom of Ishmael."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {1 "ע\"א read as abbreviation for עבודה זרה (idolatry); preserved exactly as written. The four Masorah citations appear to be addressed but were not supplied with verse references by the author."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:14.579188781Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}